 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 3 and 4, use the graph of <span data-math=\"y = 3x -1\">y = 3x -1</span> as shown.</p>\n<img alt=\"A Cartesian coordinate graph featuring a red straight line. The x-axis spans from -3 to 11, and the y-axis from -3 to 7. The line has a positive slope and intersects the y-axis at -1.\" class=\"img-fluid atto_image_button_text-bottom\" height=\"350\" src=\"exercises/media/765f1ff2388ae660.png\" width=\"400\">",
